<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43543" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēmĭ-plēnus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>half-full</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">naves,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 5, 25, § 63</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scrobes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					5, 5, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">favi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					9, 15, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Febr. 32</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stationes,</span>”
				<i>only half-filled</i>, <i>half-manned</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					25, 30 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">legiones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 80, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 112,
			2</span></i>.—* <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sēmĭ-plēnē</span></b> , <i>half in full</i>, <i>incompletely</i>, <i>in part</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dicuntur praesentia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 4, 22 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			</div>
